      "title": "SETUP - models & custom nodes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Download these four files\n\nTotal ~41 GB. Paths are relative to your `ComfyUI/models/` folder.\n\n**`diffusion_models/`**\n- [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) - 20.9 GB\n\n**`text_encoders/`**\n- [qwen3vl-32B-MiniMax-H3-Q4_K_M.gguf](https://huggingface.co/realrebelai/MiniMax-H3_GGUFs/resolve/main/qwen3vl-32B-MiniMax-H3-Q4_K_M.gguf) - 14.6 GB\n  \u26a0 **GGUF, not the stock NVFP4-AWQ encoder** - that one is CUDA-only.\n\n**`vae/`**\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors) - 5.2 GB\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) - 0.6 GB\n\n```\nComfyUI/models/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 text_encoders/qwen3vl-32B-MiniMax-H3-Q4_K_M.gguf\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n    vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n```\n\n### Custom nodes: exactly three\n- **ComfyUI-GGUF** (city96), for the text encoder. Also `pip install gguf==0.18.0` or the\n  node silently reports IMPORT FAILED.\n- **ComfyUI-AppleSilicon-FP8**, required; the int8 path will not load without it.\n- **ComfyUI-Spectrum-MiniMax-H3** (xmarre), **pinned to v0.2.3**. This graph ships with\n  Spectrum ENABLED, so without it the `SpectrumApplyMiniMaxH3` node will not resolve and the\n  workflow will not run. `install_node_packs.sh` pins it for you. If you would rather not add\n  it, delete that node and reconnect sigma shift straight to the sampler: you lose 27% speed,\n  nothing else.\n\n`ResolutionSelector` is ComfyUI core (`comfy_extras/nodes_resolution.py`), not a custom\nnode. You do not need KJNodes or Resolution-Master for this workflow.\n\n### Launch ComfyUI like this\n```\nASFP8_INT8_EXT=1 python main.py --reserve-vram 10 --cache-none --disable-smart-memory\n```\n`ASFP8_INT8_EXT=1` is not optional. The memory flags matter because H3 loads three models\nin sequence (encoder ~15 GB, DiT ~20 GB, VAEs ~6 GB) and never needs two at once.\n\n### If the model loaders show red on first load\nThe workflow uses bare stock filenames. If you keep models in subfolders, click each loader\nonce and re-pick the file. That is the only expected error."
      ],
      "color": "#2a4a2a",
      "bgcolor": "#1e3320"
    },
