      "widgets_values": [
        "Vertical smartphone-style portrait video, 28mm front camera look, soft late-afternoon window light from the left, natural skin texture, slight handheld drift, fine grain, no lettering anywhere in frame.\n\nScene overview: A woman in her late twenties stands in a bright home kitchen talking straight to camera, casual and warm, like a phone recording.\n\nStoryboard:\n[0s-5s] Shot 1: Vertical medium close-up, head and shoulders filling the upper two thirds of the frame, kitchen counter and a window softly out of focus behind her. She looks into the lens and speaks, one small nod, natural blink.\n\nCamera: Static Shot held at chest height, very slight handheld drift.\n\nAudio: her voice, close and clear with a natural American accent, faint room tone and a distant street hum underneath. She says: \"This whole clip came out of a laptop. Picture and sound, one pass, no studio.\"\n\nMusic: none\n\nNo text, subtitles, lettering, signage, logos or watermarks of any kind.",
